      "list_title": "关于开展2026年度自然资源科学技术奖推荐工作的通知",
      "list_date": "2026-09-03",
      "response": {
        "url": "https://ddy.jlu.edu.cn/info/1009/1611.htm",
        "time": "2026-10-15T22:07:31+08:00",
        "ok": true,
